{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer uses a Server / Client framework and requires port forwarding. Please refrain from buying the game for multiplayer for now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crash left you stranded on a planet. Mine and craft your way back into space, build your own starship and explore a vast, dangerous galaxy alongside your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For players who love a meaningful survival progression, a unique and elegant building system, and epic space-opera scale. </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft it. Build it. Fly it. Rule the stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive And Reach The Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Mine</strong> and harvest resources, <strong>craft</strong> better gear, and build a hovercraft to <strong>explore</strong> the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scale up production with an assembler, arc-furnace, and H2 farm. Meet the growing <strong>power</strong> demands and design an efficient <strong>inventory</strong> network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build your first spaceship and reach orbit! <strong>Explore</strong> the starting system to acquire a faster drive and better weapons. Manage fuel and oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat the pirates blocking the Stargate. The <strong>galaxy</strong> is now yours to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/50269408314d48583bba927b111cd73f.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/50269408314d48583bba927b111cd73f.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/50269408314d48583bba927b111cd73f.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Anything, from Fighters to Capital Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Stretch</strong> bricks to the perfect shape and <strong>blend grid</strong> <strong>sizes</strong> from 0.125m to 32m to create anything from small starfighters to massive dreadnoughts, mechs to space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Paint everything and apply decals to make your builds truly personal. Share on the <strong>workshop</strong> or explore the thousands of creations made by the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Engineer</strong> intricate cockpits, landing gear, and turrets using sliders, rotors, hinges, and pistons. <strong>Design</strong> the perfect interior for you and your crew down to every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use <strong>systems</strong> like artificial gravity, life support, mag-lock, and shipyard. Wire everything together and trigger <strong>logic</strong> with event gates and sensors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/a2963d69f1d7db24765608b4a35ac151.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/a2963d69f1d7db24765608b4a35ac151.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/a2963d69f1d7db24765608b4a35ac151.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your Mark in a Dangerous Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pick your fights: liberate sectors from <strong>pirates</strong> in the outer rim, or defeat <strong>factions</strong> for control toward the core. Come prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit space stations to <strong>trade</strong> goods and take on <strong>missions</strong>. Build the right ship for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be the captain: hire <strong>crewmembers</strong> from several colorful alien races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fly seamlessly from orbit to surface, explore <strong>planets</strong> and <strong>asteroid</strong> rings. Find your own place in the <strong>galaxy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b8a2a8617b7b62b78f3eb41644e3fe2b19793a66.jpg"