ong>For players who love a meaningful survival progression, a unique and elegant building system, and epic space-opera scale. </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft it. Build it. Fly it. Rule the stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/44efa9861b2186ca0cd3328f6a285248.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive And Reach The Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Mine</strong> and harvest resources, <strong>craft</strong> better gear, and build a hovercraft to <strong>explore</strong> the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scale up production with an assembler, arc-furnace, and H2 farm. Meet the growing <strong>power</strong> demands and design an efficient <strong>inventory</strong> network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build your first spaceship and reach orbit! <strong>Explore</strong> the starting system to acquire a faster drive and better weapons. Manage fuel and oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat the pirates blocking the Stargate. The <strong>galaxy</strong> is now yours to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/50269408314d48583bba927b111cd73f.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati