e your Mark in a Dangerous Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pick your fights: liberate sectors from <strong>pirates</strong> in the outer rim, or defeat <strong>factions</strong> for control toward the core. Come prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit space stations to <strong>trade</strong> goods and take on <strong>missions</strong>. Build the right ship for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be the captain: hire <strong>crewmembers</strong> from several colorful alien races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fly seamlessly from orbit to surface, explore <strong>planets</strong> and <strong>asteroid</strong> rings. Find your own place in the <strong>galaxy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.poster.avif?t=1775022736\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.webm?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/extras/1bdd0b5bdbb06d2cd4fa686ddabb4a15.mp4?t=1775022736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Moonfire Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711980/f3cc21cdfc7a8a9e888ad4839e97157d013f055e/header_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1775022736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><b